  "label": "The text 'put an end to domestic abuse!' is mapped onto the visual scene depicting domestic abuse.",
  "description": "The textual message 'put an end to domestic abuse!' directly refers to the visual scene of a man in a suit leaning over a distressed woman on the floor, which is explicitly interpreted as an instance of domestic abuse. The mapping is direct: the text calls for an end to the very situation visually portrayed. The visual material (domestic_abuse_scene) is the target of the call to action expressed in the text (text_chunk).",
